  "prefLabel": "Plc 207.06 Attendance at Hearings on Rules Proposed by a Policy-Autonomous Board",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 207.06 Attendance at Hearings on Rules Proposed by a Policy-Autonomous Board.\n\n(a) As required by RSA 541-A:11, II, for rules proposed by a policy-autonomous board, each hearing on proposed rules shall be attended by a quorum of the board’s members.\n\n(b) Board members shall not participate in any hearing on proposed rules via electronic means except in strict compliance with RSA 91-A:2, IV, as described in Plc 207.03.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Plc 200) #13427, eff 8-4-22; ss by #13837 eff 12-28-23 (formerly Plc 207.03(a)) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Plc 200)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc100-200.html"
